// Title: A Rule Has Been Deleted From The Windows Firewall Exception List
// ID: c187c075-bb3e-4c62-b4fa-beae0ffc211f
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-02-19
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1686.003
// Description: Detects when a single rules or all of the rules have been deleted from the Windows Defender Firewall
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(EventID = "2006") OR where(EventID = "2052"))) AND NOT (((where(ModifyingApplication = "")) OR ((where(ModifyingApplication ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\") OR where(ModifyingApplication ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files\\") OR where(ModifyingApplication ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\"))) OR (NOT ModifyingApplication=*) OR (where(ModifyingApplication = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\svchost.exe")))) AND NOT ((where(ModifyingApplication ISTARTSWITH "C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Platform\\") AND where(ModifyingApplication IENDSWITH "\\MsMpEng.exe"))))
